 "remarks": "LOCATION | OPPORTUNITY | Solidly built home rests on 10 Harding Street in an establish neighborhood featuring 3 levels of living space, 3 bedrooms, 2 full bathrooms, 1,628 square feet of indoor living space and .11 acres of outdoor space with fenced yard and large entertaining deck that once encompassed a large above ground pool! This humble home has 4 in wall A/C units. Hardwoods throughout that could use a glow up. Eat-in kitchen, dining area w/custom built-in hutch, living room and a 3rd floor hosting a full bathroom, 2 of the home's bedrooms, with kitchenette and potential walk-in closet. Entry level hosts the game room, laundry area and plenty of space for storage or opportunity to fully finish for even more living space! Create the perfect outdoor living space to retreat to center yourself as you bring this home to life! Great investment opportunity. Ideal for investors, flippers or a handy homeowner who wants to turn this into their dream home! Come envision the future of this home!! **INVESTOR RESEARCH; POSSIBLE TO CONVERT TO MULTI** **Watermain in currently shut off; please do NOT use the water/flush toilets",
